    "identity": "Unique sorted atomic opaque asset/generation pairs; not a provider hash requirement, receipt or credential. The shared facade re-exports the named type and result-count limit.",
    "local": "Current admitted document and every retained before/after state, including Redo. Dropped local history is outside this owner inventory.",
    "shared": "Conservative union of admitted current content and retained paired image bindings in complete native causal history under the required parent-bound map topology: all metadata effect fields plus identity/default base properties, including inactive/losing slots, deleted nodes and undone births. Does not claim minimal reachability or authorize deletion.",
    "completeness": "Reject shallow/detached/uncommitted history, retained updates with missing dependencies, unknown operations, discontinuous exported spans, malformed metadata or complete-result/work overflow. Partial binding writes/removals and aliased/inline/noncanonical structural metadata maps explicitly refuse completeness. Existing document/update admission and exact recovery bytes remain untouched.",
    "purity": "Exact observed owner publication required; read-only supported; no document/UI/history/typing/causal action, storage, fetch, upload, receipt or GC effects.",
    "limits": {
      "uniqueBindings": 100000,
      "sharedCausalAtoms": 16777216,
      "causalChunkAtoms": 1024,
      "metadataStringBytes": 65536
    },
    "future": "Separate saved versions, suggestion/revision/version outboxes, extension-owned assets, remote providers, server state and writer authority still require a coordinated recovery contract. Cross-generation Undo/offline preservation remains unimplemented."
  },
